<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS upgrades Holderbank to buy.</title>
<headline>UBS upgrades Holderbank to buy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland upgraded the shares of Holderbank Financiere Glaris Ltd to a &quot;Buy&quot; from &quot;Hold&quot; and said the stock could rise by some 20 percent to 1,200 Swiss francs within the next 12 to 18 months.</p>
<p>UBS said Holderbank's share price does not yet reflect the positive outlook for 1998 from a fundamental point of view.</p>
<p>Holderbank, a cement and building materials group, was up 26 francs at 1,026 at midday.  </p>
<p>UBS gave these forecasts in its report:</p>
<p>	Net(million Sfr)     EPS	DIV     YIELD (pct)</p>
<p>95	 463	     73.2     17	1.7</p>
<p>96E	435	     59.9     17	1.7</p>
<p>97E	545	     75.1     18	1.8</p>
<p>98E	680	     93.7     18	1.8</p>
<p>--Zurich newsroom +41 1631 7340</p>
</text>
